{"unit_id":"Lovenndme__dsh-command-context#card-zh","repo":"Lovenndme/dsh-command-context","commit":"fa34da9628906a8eb1f2cf0bedf9343ac6f23c00","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-command-context 是面向 DeepSeek Harness 网页端的上下文查看插件，通过全局 /context 命令读取当前会话的 token 计量结果，显示上下文窗口已用比例、剩余空间和按类别拆分的占用。输入 /context top [N] 还可查看占用最大的会话节点，并用工具名标识工具结果；N 默认 5、最多 20。报告可切换中英文，也会在可用时展示压缩触发点。适合需要了解提示词由哪些部分占用、排查单个大工具输出的 DSH 用户。使用 DSH 0.2.1-rc.5 兼容范围内的宿主服务，无需额外密钥或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:620-674","index.js:344-446","client.js:73-87"]}
{"unit_id":"Lovenndme__dsh-command-context#card-en","repo":"Lovenndme/dsh-command-context","commit":"fa34da9628906a8eb1f2cf0bedf9343ac6f23c00","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-command-context adds /context to DeepSeek Harness. It shows session token usage, free space and category totals. /context top [N] lists largest nodes and tool names. Use /context en or zh to switch language. It may show the compaction trigger. Requires compatible host services; no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:620-674","index.js:344-446","client.js:73-87"]}
